🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps crashing because its containers get too little time to start. The replicas were scaled from 2 to 4 at 10:01. It fails with "Startup probe failed: Get "http://10.244.0.12:8080/healthz": context deadline exceeded". Fix in: deployment/api → container app → startupProbe (initialDelaySeconds 0, periodSeconds 10, failureThreshold 3). To see the rollout state, run kubectl rollout status deployment/api -n shop
🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps crashing because its containers get too little time to start.
| 🟠 **api** in **shop** (**prod-eu-1**) keeps crashing because its containers get too little time to start.
| The replicas were scaled from 2 to 4 at 10:01.
| It fails with `Startup probe failed: Get`http://10.244.0.12:8080/healthz`: context deadline exceeded`.
| Fix in: deployment/api → container app → startupProbe (initialDelaySeconds 0, periodSeconds 10, failureThreshold 3).
| To see the rollout state, run
| ```
| kubectl rollout status deployment/api -n shop
| ```
